<title>USA: American Resources debentures converted.</title>
<headline>American Resources debentures converted.</headline>
<dateline>VERSAILLES, Ky. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Resources of Delaware Inc said all of the convertible debentures it issued in the fourth quarter of 1996 had been converted or redeemed as of June 9.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said the company's proceeds totaled $4,997,554 after placement costs were paid from gross proceeds of $6 million.</p>
<p>&quot;We were very fortunate to have been able to use the net proceeds of the debentures to greatly enhance our cash flow through the expansion of our position in the Gulf Coast region,&quot; said Chief Executive Rick Avare.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
